          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 131820,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lass uns erkunden, wie man <code>continue</code>, <code>break</code> und <code>else</code> verwendet, um den Schleifenfluss zu steuern, Iterationen zu überspringen, frühzeitig zu beenden oder Code nach der Schleife auszuführen.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2 - Copy",
            "id": 131844,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>continue</code> wird verwendet, um den aktuellen Block zu überspringen und zur nächsten Iteration zu wechseln.</p><p>Stelle sicher, dass die Zahl <code>2</code> nicht gedruckt wird.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i == \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"continue\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>==</code>, gefolgt von <code>continue</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>continue</code> wird verwendet, um den aktuellen Block zu überspringen und zur nächsten Iteration zu wechseln.</p><p>Setze beim Vergleich <code>i</code> auf die linke und die Zahl auf die rechte Seite.</p><p>Lass die Schleife <code>1</code>, <code>3</code>, <code>4</code> und <code>5</code> ausgeben, indem du die Iteration für <code>2</code> überspringst.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i == \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"continue\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>i</code>, gefolgt von <code>==</code>, <code>2</code> und schließlich <code>continue</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 131821,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verwende <code>continue</code>, um bestimmte Elemente zu überspringen, wie <code>\"chips\"</code> in einer Schleife, und zur nächsten Iteration zu wechseln.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shopping_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;apples&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bananas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bread&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;chips&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shopping_list:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item == \" /><text value=\"&quot;chips&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"continue\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Don't forget to buy: \" /><text value=\"{item}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"126\" endIndex=\"134\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Don't forget to buy: apples\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Don't forget to buy: bananas\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Don't forget to buy: bread\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Don't forget to buy: milk\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Don't forget to buy: eggs\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>continue</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3 - Copy",
            "id": 131845,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die <code>break</code>-Anweisung beendet die Schleife vollständig. Wenn sie aufgerufen wird, werden die restlichen Iterationen nicht ausgeführt.</p><p>Lass uns eine <code>break</code>-Anweisung zum Programm hinzufügen, um die Schleife zu stoppen, wenn <code>i</code> den Wert <code>3</code> erreicht.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i == \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>==</code>, gefolgt von <code>break</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die <code>break</code>-Anweisung beendet die Schleife vollständig. Wenn sie aufgerufen wird, werden die restlichen Iterationen nicht ausgeführt.</p><p>Setze beim Vergleich <code>i</code> auf die linke und die Zahl auf die rechte Seite.</p><p>Lass die Schleife <code>1</code>, <code>2</code> und <code>3</code> ausgeben und stoppe sie, bevor sie <code>4</code> ausgibt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"range\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>i</code>, gefolgt von <code>==</code>, <code>4</code> und schließlich <code>break</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 131823,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir können das <code>break</code>-Keyword verwenden, um eine <code>while</code>-Schleife zu verlassen, wenn eine bestimmte Bedingung erfüllt ist, wie zum Beispiel ein passendes Passwort.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"password = \" /><text value=\"&quot;open_sesame&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" input(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enter the password: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") == password:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Access granted!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Incorrect password. Try again.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"119\" endIndex=\"124\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Incorrect password. Try again.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Incorrect password. Try again.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Access granted!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>break</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 131825,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Schließlich wird die <code>else</code>-Anweisung in Schleifen ausgeführt, wenn die Schleife beendet ist. Denke daran, dass <code>else</code> in einer Schleife sich von <code>else</code> in einer <code>if</code>-Anweisung unterscheidet.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"'Loop has ended'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Loop has ended\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>else</code>, gefolgt von <code>:</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die <code>else</code>-Anweisung in Schleifen wird ausgeführt, wenn die Schleife beendet ist.</p><p>Denke daran: <code>else</code> in einer Schleife unterscheidet sich von <code>else</code> in einer <code>if</code>-Anweisung.</p><p>Vervollständige den letzten Zweig, damit das Programm nach allen fünf Zahlen <code>Loop has ended</code> ausgibt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"'Loop has ended'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"break\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'Loop is running'\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Loop has ended\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>else</code>, gefolgt von <code>:</code>, <code>print</code> und schließlich <code>'Loop has ended'</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 131826,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der <code>else</code>-Block wird nur ausgeführt, wenn die Schleife nicht vorzeitig durch ein <code>break</code>-Statement beendet wird.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i == \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(i)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loop has ended.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"62\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>break</code>, gefolgt von <code>else:</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der <code>else</code>-Block wird nur ausgeführt, wenn die Schleife nicht vorzeitig durch ein <code>break</code>-Statement beendet wird.</p><p>Stoppe vor <code>8</code>, damit das Programm <code>1</code> bis <code>7</code> ohne die Abschlussmeldung ausgibt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"range\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loop has ended.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>==</code>, gefolgt von <code>8</code>, <code>break</code> und schließlich <code>else</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 131868,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code das fehlende Schlüsselwort, um eine abschließende Anweisung auszugeben, nachdem die Schleife alle Elemente durchlaufen hat.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shows = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;The Office&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dexter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Friends&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" show \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shows:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(show)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Those are my favorite shows!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"break\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"The Office\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Dexter\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Friends\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Those are my favorite shows!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>else</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib jede Sendung aus und gib erst dann <code>Those are my favorite shows!</code> aus, wenn die Schleife die gesamte Liste durchlaufen hat.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shows = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;The Office&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dexter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Friends&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" show \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" shows:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(show)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Those are my favorite shows!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"shows\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"break\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"The Office\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Dexter\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Friends\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Those are my favorite shows!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>show</code>, gefolgt von <code>else</code> und schließlich <code>\"Those are my favorite shows!\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 131869,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welches Schlüsselwort überspringt den Rest der aktuellen Iteration und startet die nächste Iteration?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>continue</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>break</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>continue</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eine Schleife findet eine erledigte Aufgabe. Sie soll diese Iteration überspringen, aber später weitermachen. Welches Schlüsselwort passt?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>continue</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>break</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>else</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>continue</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 131870,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Stelle sicher, dass wir keine abgeschlossenen Aufgaben verarbeiten.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;pending&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;completed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;pending&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;pending&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"index = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" index &lt; len(tasks):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks[index] == \" /><text value=\"&quot;completed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Skipping task \" /><text value=\"{index + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    index += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"continue\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Processing task \" /><text value=\"{index + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  index += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"185\" endIndex=\"193\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"break\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Processing task 1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Skipping task 2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Processing task 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Processing task 4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>continue</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Überspringe die abgeschlossene Aufgabe, damit die Aufgaben <code>3</code> und <code>4</code> noch verarbeitet werden.</p><p>Der Zähler <code>index</code> wählt die Aufgabe aus. Erhöhe ihn um eins, bevor du den restlichen Block überspringst, um die nächste Aufgabe zu erreichen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"tasks = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;pending&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;completed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;pending&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;pending&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"index = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" index &lt; len(tasks):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tasks[index] == \" /><text value=\"&quot;completed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Skipping task \" /><text value=\"{index + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    index += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"continue\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Processing task \" /><text value=\"{index + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  index += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex